  "message": "wp892: va Codex luot 3 — CLI nhanh co manh hop le phai gom thanh cong, dong tat dung hop dong, doi chung env vang (#892)\n\n- P2 gom-duong-nhanh-chua-khoa-dispatcher-cli: F17 them cli_git_dn_dung/cli_git_dn_nhieu (kho git\n  tam, van tay that, env nhanh) phai ra Y HET cli_git_dung/cli_git_nhieu; dong tat CLI rc 0 phai co\n  CONG_CU_TEST_GOP_CHE_DO=duong_nhanh va khong co 'giet'.\n- P3 gom-tu-kiem-mat-doi-chung-env-vang (chu kho chon va): ban NHE cua --tu-kiem-gom\n  (CONG_CU_TEST_TU_KIEM_GOM_NHE=1, hai o loi nhanh+rong / vang+rong, ~0,4 s) chay duoi env VANG,\n  phai ra nhu ban du; rc khac 0 la chot cua t52 (bang), khong phai chot gian giao.\n  Gioi han: dot bien co y chi pha ban DU khi env vang ma chua ban nhe thi khong bi bat.\n- Dot bien moi: wp892_dispatcher_nhanh_thanh_cong_do, wp892_dispatcher_noi_giet,\n  wp892_tu_kiem_vang_rc1 (490 tong); neo lai wp892_ro_env_ngoai.\n\nDo: 20/20 wp892_* giet dung t52, ban kinh 1/61, loi 0; f9_sha_hang f9_head_hang\nbn_ban_kinh_giau_ly_do f15_tk_chi_dau f27_entry_rc f34_source_text_bytes ve 1/61 dung dich;\nCONG_CU_TEST_BAN_KINH=manh: 61 ca, loi dot bien 0; ruff F = nen (1).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QFJQm8mNRrRmPUhkqciiC2",
